	"bugClass": {
		"id": "stale-blocker-filter",
		"title": "Blocker inbox omits in-progress rows with blocker notes",
		"cause": "A blocker inbox filters rows using a flag/status field but fails to include in-progress rows whose current blocker note independently marks them as blocked. The same eligibility contract can be missed in sibling CLI or API list paths.",
		"criteria": "A site exhibits this cause if a blocker-focused list omits an in-progress item with a current blocker note when its explicit flag is unset. Each relevant list path can exhibit the failure independently; status summaries that intentionally show only status and flags do not qualify.",
